{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "91d5144d121afb6fff99b48c4cfd462ebf053cabccd5b4cf734eb5db204d6048", "ja": "私たちの挑戦", "zh": "我们的挑战", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d2e6e4e07b147cfb962139267a6da6445a67a80ddc700c121157210cf72d0ef4", "ja": "先輩達からアドバイスを受けたものの、\nすぐにはうまくいかない旗作り。息抜きと\nアイデアを求め3人はショッピングモール\nで、今まで欲しくても我慢していた物を\n買ってみることに。", "zh": "虽然获得了前辈们的建议，\n旗帜制作仍然没有迅速的进展。\n为了喘口气并寻求灵感，\n三个人来到购物中心，\n尝试购买她们一直忍住没买的商品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f080fbb224f3200731820515a8ea53bb6ee783b13533f09536aa9b62e5b197f5", "ja": "（みんなで作る旗、どんなものにするか一歩\n前進したと思うが、みんなの様子は……）", "zh": "（大家一起制作旗帜的计划已经具体迈进了一步，\n不过现在她们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "b968b7d3bafe8501398d7b68ef841cf1d2010d79b1fc2743b468cbea04747d49", "ja": "うーん、やっぱ黄緑のチークって微妙かも。\nでも、あずさも挑戦はいいことだって言ってたし……。", "zh": "唔──我还是觉得黄绿色的腮红有种说不上来的怪。\n不过，阿梓姊都说勇于挑战是好事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "59c60b25624bf89d02a06bc68b7ca0bf7b7d9114f8658b12363ed705df319a8c", "ja": "よし！　じゃあ青いチークに挑戦してみよ！\n案外いいかもしんないしね！", "zh": "好！那我就来挑战蓝色腮红吧！\n也许会很好看呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c6972be0797f367312b7fa156ea12a8d0f47667e2bb79ddfd0fa0007093ebe40", "ja": "アタシは、この新しいターンを完成させるっ！\n努力は自分を裏切らない！ いっくぞ〜！", "zh": "我要完成这个新的转圈动作！\n努力是不会背叛我的！要开始啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aa0ef20fd4bc702bdcb74908f870000dc53cf2f496511852b27307fbec7caa5a", "ja": "100回転ターン！　くるくるくるくる……、\nああうっ、目が回るぅぅぅ！", "zh": "转圈100次！我转我转我转我转……\n啊啊呜，头昏眼花了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1005_se", "source_sha256": "a2400d039f1042fc5fa46de59ef16f6d63bc277a5f8b497fd3d321bd901842a8", "ja": "（ガッシャンドンガラ！！）", "zh": "（喀锵咚嘎啦！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "6217aa4dec10cba4c82da4f7ca97266be993830ca9f2cbd86c573cb708c9d208", "ja": "心頭滅却……将来、三浦さんのような胸を手に\n入れても、クールさを保つイメトレを今の内から……。", "zh": "静下心来……就算以后胸部变得和三浦姊一样，\n我也要保持酷酷形象，就趁现在开始做想像练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "28693bf691b94782c41ad42c1899c839470a6a805780dc020b66253b685b669b", "ja": "……わくわく。はっ、今、とても顔がにやけて……。\nファイトだぞ瑞希。心頭滅却、……常にクールであれ。", "zh": "……（兴奋不已）啊！我刚刚偷笑了……\n要加油啊，瑞希。静下心来……随时保持冷静。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "07abe14fbb0ca8c080811a04013c49484ad9e37806914e5b26986f9eb2e2ad1a", "ja": "な、何やってるんだ、みんな……？", "zh": "你、你们在做什么啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "30476b2becc991113b4731f3e54d0e44ca0fb1cdad5b13b8c85e0593e2a41ec1", "ja": "あ……。秘密です。", "zh": "啊……这是秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "922eac6cade7bac7da22117d5960298f621890f4db043239640a1eb0840465f0", "ja": "つまり……、とっぷしーくれっと、です。", "zh": "也就是……Top secret喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b5b89ddd0da1357fd4e356fe5d869a9d55aecf9e9b501b2e92248d74764489a6", "ja": "そういうことじゃなくて。\nなんだかみんな、迷走してないか……？", "zh": "我不是那个意思。\n我只是觉得你们好像失去方向了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "a1b495553e02edcfa994a91ac86d2419153f7dee4abf8fd8e24d30a04edddbfe", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　みんなで\nいろいろ試してるんだけど、やっぱなかなか難しいね！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！我们在做各种尝试，\n不过还是很困难耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "35f040d231fd7d1f770d5c14f60523d329a88ff2c8682eb1f93c555055610cb1", "ja": "いや、試行錯誤は大切だと思う。でもそれと同じ\nくらい、休憩もな。みんなそろそろ喉がかわかないか？", "zh": "不会啊，我觉得反复尝试是很重要的。\n不过适度休息也同样重要，你们应该都口渴了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb0f7105a2e5c43c43147325955d7e508e6ca116c9608413336f97d69666dfe7", "ja": "そういえば……。なんか飲んで、気分転換でもすれば、\nいいアイデアでるかな？", "zh": "这么一说……先喝点东西，放松心情后，\n或许就能想出好点子了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "bfef6e844d7423006d8d858e2b6fc6c451e30d748ac6c00a21c6d7c0e51c3709", "ja": "あっ！　じゃあみんなで買い出しにでも行く？\nショッピングモールなら、ジュースとかもあるよね♪", "zh": "啊！那要不要大家一起出去采购呢？\n购物中心那边应该有卖果汁之类的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0c24b1b35d506148f25de0915c3a781edeabedfcfdbe28698eebfab9b265bb8c", "ja": "じゃあ散歩がてら、みんなで行ってみようか！", "zh": "那就顺便散个步，大家一起过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cc96de61744b1525344ad6c0a0463f083aac92b3f6fd1197b04a637d19067719", "ja": "（というわけで、みんなでショッピングモールに\n来てみた。少しでも気晴らしになるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（就这样，我们来到了购物中心。\n希望可以帮助她们散散心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "0cbed8a5fe2f782f0f68791d364a8b2a607e5a76f55bcd97c197c8e9a790f245", "ja": "あのね、みんな。アタシいい考えがあるんだ！\n上手くいったら、旗作りとか公演のヒントになるかも！", "zh": "大家听我说，我想到一个好点子！\n顺利的话，也许能成为旗帜和公演的灵感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "532cf99857a759c0e1d278e17659d09cf144456d2d5575632bc30b06c7b57923", "ja": "なんでしょう所さん。\nぜひ聞かせてください。", "zh": "是什么点子呢，所？\n愿闻其详。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "4cdee6a7b05fc965ec407577cb7e55f1d28e8bf7e9d3182eeb1743011b350af3", "ja": "買うきっかけがないけど、欲しいものってあるでしょ？\n思い切って、今日はそれを買うの！　みんなで！", "zh": "不是有些东西虽然想要，但没机会买吗？\n今天就狠下心把那样东西买下来！大家都要买！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "97ba2320185a214f8a362f36c8bc415046fe569be817dab2f0b61afbbe27c889", "ja": "なるほど……新しいものにチャレンジする気持ちを\n大切にして、自分の気持ちにも正直になれる……。", "zh": "原来如此……这样既能挑战新的事物，\n还能面对自己真正的感受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b3b6d2f3875efd85959b9ae589035ff7b91b8791cfc3b854f0e070fd2a8e5142", "ja": "いいね！　じゃあ……。あれ？　アタシ、いつもなに\nガマンしてたんだっけ。うー、急には思い出せない！", "zh": "不错耶！那……奇怪？我平常忍着不买的东西是什么啊？\n呜──突然想不起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "9377fd1af5ce6e97db3ab2d15d2c5ea0f4c5646a46629180f3735046b30cbd1f", "ja": "それがキモなんだよね～。自分が隠してたヨクボーを\nジカクするっての？　それって革新的じゃん♪", "zh": "这就是关键所在啊～就像是在发掘自己\n内心隐藏的欲望吧？这样不是很革新吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "656dcdeb1426311b14ef348831236d1844a55b830538abac2e78ec085a24c411", "ja": "確かに、そうかもしれないな……。\n恵美、よく考えているじゃないか！", "zh": "这么说好像也是……\n惠美，你这想法真不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "02e98f34c8ddd6e1e4c71b84d7594508c2f44e46789bc39a795c888d9f3f94e0", "ja": "にゃはは♪\nたまたま思いついただけだけどね～。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪\n其实我只是灵光一闪而已啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "759082038231f55f0c9dde698d6b57f1d593b0c53239feee7183e0aa3dcc3486", "ja": "あ、ちなみに{$P$}もだよ！\n何か欲しいもの買っちゃいなよ！　今日だけ！　ね？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}你也要喔！\n买个自己想要的东西吧！放纵一天就好！好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "369126627067e3528768ac0331f169100a8b671a6450ba53607057cc19e44472", "ja": "え、俺も？　……俺の欲しいものか。俺もなかなか、\n思いつかないけど……まあ、一緒に探してみるか。", "zh": "什么？我也要……？我也想不太到自己想要什么耶……\n也罢，我跟你们一起找找看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "482197652d6c1dcaed97f30e371b07b4dce80286061be44ec73a04345a2b7837", "ja": "うん、そうして♪　ま、そういうアタシも、\nまだ見つかってないんだけど……って、ああっ！", "zh": "嗯，就这么办♪\n其实我自己也还不知道要买什么啦……咦？啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "40e30325d133f90b3244fab74dc45a51320bb33e3bbc00b41014abf853c0366c", "ja": "これ、めっちゃかっこいいかもっ！\n……あ、でももしかして……。", "zh": "这个感觉超帅的耶！\n……啊，可是该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "109d823280715e644b887cf306d0eae257d0bddb817d14430f6bb0f0e988043e", "ja": "（ん？　恵美はアクセサリーショップで、\n同じブレスレットをいくつも手にとっている……）", "zh": "（嗯？惠美在饰品店里，\n拿着好几条一样的手链……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4fd281cca799e756fc73ca285a604bea5780a9e41a7ae774caa5b3acb239c632", "ja": "（もしかして、最近の若い子の間では、同じのを\nたくさんつけるのが流行って……いるのか？）", "zh": "（该不会时下年轻人流行\n一次戴好几个重复的饰品吧……有这种流行吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "82210ec50ec00a923c5ecee47264b484e3500253525717d91b5d3d60621367d2", "ja": "んー。アタシの、欲しいもの。\nんー。んー……。", "zh": "嗯──我想要的东西是什么？\n嗯──嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "00d03ca22a47af247d1f9511d2a34d04f6845509f17de94752b3ccd02c8bf6d5", "ja": "こ、これだーっ！", "zh": "就、就是这个了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "4e4522540e0b607451b53732c58d3b383e981da85f7e1e9cb4a3dd9d18a28b1d", "ja": "っと、こっちでは歩が……本屋に？", "zh": "喔？步在这边……是书店？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "98451b8332ff06d2a970e898236d7875ade9b2c3eb5b323a42eb5e77b6a845c6", "ja": "舞浜さん、何か発見したのですか。", "zh": "舞滨姊，你发现什么东西了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "48e9b58167a759104f86c96fd421c1c34fbde5a12ff4d7c3a7fa5a830aadde4b", "ja": "ああ、この本！\nこれこそアタシが求めてたものだよっ！！", "zh": "没错，就是这本书！\n它就是我想要的东西！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "51b897656545de4a0badb2e681268513db4fc4f26c5c2ba5b541b09ec0fa1268", "ja": "『初心者でもわかる！ナンバーワン英会話～CD付き』\nなるほど、英語の本か。", "zh": "《初学者也看得懂！No.1英语会话～附CD》──\n原来如此，是英语教学书啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3d15ddb7bdb195198202a380a7b56ec4c783b9de55e8404f5c4a7aa4e3c8501c", "ja": "え、英語ってさ、基礎が大事なんだ。\nだから、勉強し直しておこうかなって。", "zh": "呃，因为学英文要打好基础嘛。\n所以我想说要温故知新一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "9569d905ee2ab965d39c65eb9238f86465a755beb22cb45ed39825d1610a0e8d", "ja": "…………。\nそ、そうか。うん、そうかもしれないな！", "zh": "…………\n这、这样啊。嗯，你说得也对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9fadcb185f4e2d7270ca72db2a9e0a3eec91b5e4ce41d69a7f052773fc07e0c2", "ja": "今後、アメリカとかでも仕事あるかもしれないし！\nトップを目指すなら、英語は必須だよな！", "zh": "毕竟以后也有可能到美国工作嘛！\n想要成为顶尖偶像，英语能力是必备的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8dade3dcf6312848e3fcf2bdccaf907f484cd18b5542897c8ebd1a4e7949aa82", "ja": "アタシ、今度は本気でやってみるから！\nもうへこたれないよ！", "zh": "这次我会认真学的！\n不会再半途而废！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "c1a74e6aeb72f75f3a64fd31e6c4592e7a8e5b55143fbf63f3005d31e290fd1e", "ja": "おお、かっこいい！　すっごくいいコトじゃん！\nチャレンジしてみなよ！", "zh": "喔喔，好帅喔！这样子很棒啊！\n你就挑战看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1045_044miz", "source_sha256": "4763bfc6688027ad9abc8f59425c4f78dfb7afad59ca93c7941a25035932c887", "ja": "いいですね、舞浜さん、さっそく見つけましたね。\n……前向きポジティブ、ワクワク。", "zh": "真是不错，舞滨姊，你很快就找到了呢。\n……要积极向上。（兴奋不已）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1046_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "70f23da11c12a645169aae4469ca62af12b7f5c8c4826b2f7cda7642968a7062", "ja": "そこのお嬢さん……\nショートカットの……お嬢さん……。", "zh": "那边那位小姐……\n留短头发的……小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "c1f14337bdb1508c53c99ce5d7d6c13aade69b19890a00f696343ba7deb0f560", "ja": "ショートカット……。\nは、もしかして私のことですか？", "zh": "短头发……\n啊，莫非是指我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1048_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "2a7d833aac1f677f3d084d546a5a33b9a719044f970c205ee561557ff57256d8", "ja": "ええ……そうです。……何か、貴方は……\nお困りのことが、あるのでは……ないですか？", "zh": "是的……就是你……请问你……\n是不是有什么……困扰呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1049_044miz", "source_sha256": "80abcfb73f083f89ef44a413885b2612a144d23902497012a9e19bcb996b47ce", "ja": "！！　な、なぜわかるんですか。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "唔！！你、你为什么会知道？……（紧张万分）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "56bfa3487825e0978d58250ae0a9e81c2a39e8c32317ee9491d436ce4d4eee1b", "ja": "（ん？　瑞希が何者かに喋りかけられてるぞ……？）", "zh": "（嗯？好像有人找瑞希说话……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1051_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "628d83ce317e602fbb2b0492eaa5f32574b381564acca35099c317640c3b2f67", "ja": "わかりますとも……一度、私のお店に来てください。\nきっと……お役に立てるかと。", "zh": "我当然会知道……请你来我的店里一趟吧。\n肯定……会对你有所帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1052_044miz", "source_sha256": "99c11b7bcf8eabeb6c9a02b7cefad25a37867b2a395c3c48041a2f9f96f43133", "ja": "あ、あなたは……何者ですか？", "zh": "请、请问你……是什么人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1053_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "5742c9bf04d737b3ac44c7d90647e7fd4616d9cedd718561c482e88406c77af9", "ja": "私は……、実は……。", "zh": "是这样的……我是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_04_1054_p", "source_sha256": "7d0d839d4dd3d67cc91c9722195bcbcb9d2baebfc3a6c5caaa71af094bcf76fa", "ja": "（な、なんだこの尋常じゃないオーラの女性は？\nこれは只者じゃなさそうだ……！！）", "zh": "（这、这位散发出不寻常气场的女性是谁？\n看起来非同小可啊……！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
